GAAiXST3FEinplJZUsxm3UNYydXImGBr7Um3YRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5DCHVCIihsuZ9qbUHkMbOIyyFbFGuUv1UraYIYseXlA&oe=6AF9E8E1"}, {"file_name": "01-browser.png", "id": "2432952877510539", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_2432952887510538_6430410702380026795_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G9uLOsxZKNsQ7kNvwGCBntI&_nc_oc=AdpLuSkgeJNhK8iD8RY7-lRY1ZAivDVLrxwVT3l-8IJB_wjyv5nlAGjkZXZ8GlQ5VSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTiTX_1DtjVVGTmLHUF-YeXHCk6UI4oHpWVvelq1ZJXvA&oe=6AF9E900"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VibeAR", "keywords": ["code", "vibe", "ai", "cockpit", "productivity"], "long_description": "**Your terminal, your editor and your agents \u2014 in the room with you.**\n\nVibeAR turns your Quest into a mixed-reality cockpit for your computer. Windows float in passthrough around your real desk: as many terminals as you need, browsers, notes, code and PDF viewers, 3D models, and a live mirror of your Mac screen. Move them with a pinch, keep your keyboard visible, and get back to work.\n\n**Built for coding with AI agents**\n- Run Claude Code, Codex or any CLI in floating terminals, each with its own voice and dictation\n- Agents open files, diffs, web pages and control panels as windows next to you\n- Talk to your workspace: dictate into any window, ask for a file, a page or a new terminal\n\n**Your whole computer, without the monitor**\n- Live screen mirror of your Mac, with keyboard and mouse passthrough\n- Multiple workspaces you switch from the palm menu, each remembering its windows\n- Everything stays on your local network \u2014 your screen and terminals never leave the LAN\n\n**Hands only**\nNo controllers. Look at your palm for the menu, pinch to click, pinch-and-drag to move. A short tutorial gets you there in two minutes.\n\n**Requires the free VibeAR companion app on a Mac (Apple silicon, macOS 13+) on the same Wi-Fi.** Windows support is coming. Subscription or one-time purchase \u2014 buy once, every future release included.", "short_description": "You vibe coding cockpit, in AR"}]}, "developer_name": "TRMZ Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vibear.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TRMZ Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vibear.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1324329224101511"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1880590149577116_843453320241520231_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5l9IvvYiCn8Q7kNvwHn5Mf_&_nc_oc=AdrBM0hfsilwSvZitzuB_81VZZShu6Fbidq8vs1GWfW8niFZ2eRBDzd6i1hIGfHm8m8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIaesohWM1GywEqhdKcGkG0tOSlP5hYWyQ9NJ7Hb2t3Q&oe=6AF9C098"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "VibeAR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Utilities", "id": "393222478507326"}, {"topic_name": "Productivity", "id": "1063584910766706"}], "release_date": 1793746800, "lastRevisio